-- This script handles:
-- - TickBoxes (toggle on/off with colored state)
-- - Buttons (click to execute actions)
-- - Tooltips (hover hints)
-- - Minimize functionality
-- - Automatic cleanup
--
-- HOW TO USE:
-- 1. Place this script under your Group frame (e.g., AntiGroup, MovementGroup)
-- 2. Scroll to the bottom where it says "ADD YOUR FEATURES HERE"
